<title>NETHERLANDS: Hoogovens over-allotment option exercised.</title>
<headline>Hoogovens over-allotment option exercised.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Rothschild said on Monday the syndicate backing the issue of 10 year 4.625 percent subordinated convertible bonds by steel and aluminium group Hoogovens had exercised its option to take up more convertibles to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>&quot;This implies that the total size of the issue has been increased by a nominal 45 million guilders to a nominal total of 345 million guilders,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The issue was announced on April 15 and closed on April 16, two days earlier than previously planned as it had been oversubscribed more than three times.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
